{"seq":1,"slug":"interactive-rebase","title":"交互式变基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/interactive-rebase","wordCount":735,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"交互式变基\">交互式变基</h1><h2 id=\"什么是交互式变基\">什么是交互式变基</h2><p><strong>交互式变基（Interactive Rebase）</strong> 是 <code>git rebase</code> 的增强模式，允许你在变基过程中逐个编辑提交。它是整理提交历史最强大的工具。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git rebase -i HEAD~5&#10;&#10;git rebase -i main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span></code></pre></div><p>执行后 Git 会打开编辑器，列出指定范围内的所有提交：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pick a1b2c3d feat: add login page&#10;pick e4f5g6h fix: typo in login form&#10;pick i7j8k9l feat: add validation&#10;pick m0n1o2p fix: validation edge case&#10;pick q3r4s5t feat: add remember me checkbox\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> a1b2c3d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> e4f5g6h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> form</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i7j8k9l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> validation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> m0n1o2p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> validation</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> edge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> case</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> q3r4s5t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remember</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> me</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkbox</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>交互式变基把&quot;重写一段历史&quot;拆成对每个提交的逐条指令，核心概念围绕这些指令与其适用边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>todo 列表</td>\n<td>变基时打开的提交清单，每行一条操作指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pick</td>\n<td>原样保留提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>reword</td>\n<td>保留内容，仅改提交消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>edit</td>\n<td>暂停在该提交，允许修改内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>squash</td>\n<td>与前一个提交合并并保留两条消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fixup</td>\n<td>与前一个提交合并并丢弃本条消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>drop</td>\n<td>完全删除提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>autosquash</td>\n<td>依据 --fixup/--squash 标记自动排布 todo</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"六种操作命令\">六种操作命令</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pick</td>\n<td>p</td>\n<td>保留该提交不做修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>reword</td>\n<td>r</td>\n<td>保留提交内容，修改提交消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>edit</td>\n<td>e</td>\n<td>暂停在该提交，允许修改内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>squash</td>\n<td>s</td>\n<td>与前一个提交合并，保留两者的提交消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fixup</td>\n<td>f</td>\n<td>与前一个提交合并，丢弃该提交的消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>drop</td>\n<td>d</td>\n<td>完全删除该提交</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[pick: 保留原样] --&gt; G[最终历史]&#10;    B[reword: 改消息] --&gt; G&#10;    C[edit: 改内容] --&gt; G&#10;    D[squash: 合并+保留消息] --&gt; G&#10;    E[fixup: 合并+丢弃消息] --&gt; G&#10;    F[drop: 删除] --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[pick: 保留原样] --&gt; G[最终历史]\n    B[reword: 改消息] --&gt; G\n    C[edit: 改内容] --&gt; G\n    D[squash: 合并+保留消息] --&gt; G\n    E[fixup: 合并+丢弃消息] --&gt; G\n    F[drop: 删除] --&gt; G</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"reword-修改提交消息\">Reword：修改提交消息</h2><p>修改历史中某个提交的消息而不改变其内容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git rebase -i HEAD~3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>将目标提交的 <code>pick</code> 改为 <code>reword</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"reword a1b2c3d feat: add login page&#10;pick e4f5g6h fix: typo in login form&#10;pick i7j8k9l feat: add validation\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reword</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> a1b2c3d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> e4f5g6h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> form</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i7j8k9l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> validation</span></span></code></pre></div><p>保存后 Git 会打开新的编辑器让你修改该提交的消息。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 只需修改提交消息时用 reword，不要手动在 todo list 中修改消息文本——那不会生效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"edit-修改提交内容\">Edit：修改提交内容</h2><p>暂停变基过程，让你修改某个历史提交的文件内容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git rebase -i HEAD~4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~4</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pick a1b2c3d feat: add login page&#10;edit e4f5g6h fix: typo in login form&#10;pick i7j8k9l feat: add validation&#10;pick m0n1o2p fix: validation edge case\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> a1b2c3d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">edit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> e4f5g6h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> form</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i7j8k9l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> validation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> m0n1o2p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> validation</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> edge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> case</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Git 暂停后：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 修改文件&#10;vi src/login.sh&#10;&#10;# 将修改加入暂存区&#10;git add src/login.sh&#10;&#10;# 修改提交（也可以用 --amend 修改消息）&#10;git commit --amend&#10;&#10;# 继续变基&#10;git rebase --continue\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 修改文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/login.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 将修改加入暂存区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/login.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 修改提交（也可以用 --amend 修改消息）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --amend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 继续变基</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --continue</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"squash-与-fixup-合并提交\">Squash 与 Fixup：合并提交</h2><p>将多个零碎提交合并为一个有意义的提交：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pick a1b2c3d feat: add login page&#10;squash e4f5g6h fix: typo in login form&#10;fixup i7j8k9l fix: another typo&#10;pick m0n1o2p feat: add validation\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> a1b2c3d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">squash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> e4f5g6h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> form</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fixup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i7j8k9l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> another</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> m0n1o2p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> validation</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>提交内容</th>\n<th>提交消息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>squash</td>\n<td>合并</td>\n<td>打开编辑器合并两条消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fixup</td>\n<td>合并</td>\n<td>自动使用前一个提交的消息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"unknown\" data-source=\"gitGraph&#10;    commit id: &quot;A: feat login&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;B: fix typo&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;C: fix typo2&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;D: feat validation&quot;\">gitGraph\n    commit id: \"A: feat login\"\n    commit id: \"B: fix typo\"\n    commit id: \"C: fix typo2\"\n    commit id: \"D: feat validation\"</pre><p>squash 后：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"unknown\" data-source=\"gitGraph&#10;    commit id: &quot;A&#39;: feat login (含修复)&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;D: feat validation&quot;\">gitGraph\n    commit id: \"A': feat login (含修复)\"\n    commit id: \"D: feat validation\"</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"drop-删除提交\">Drop：删除提交</h2><p>从历史中完全删除某个提交：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pick a1b2c3d feat: add login page&#10;drop e4f5g6h debug: add console logs&#10;pick i7j8k9l feat: add validation\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> a1b2c3d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drop</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> e4f5g6h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> debug:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> console</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i7j8k9l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> validation</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> drop 某个提交可能导致后续提交产生冲突，因为后续提交可能依赖被删除提交引入的更改。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"调整提交顺序\">调整提交顺序</h2><p>交互式变基还允许通过调整行的顺序来重排提交：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pick i7j8k9l feat: add validation&#10;pick a1b2c3d feat: add login page&#10;pick e4f5g6h fix: typo in login form\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i7j8k9l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> validation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> a1b2c3d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feat:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> e4f5g6h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> typo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> form</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"autosquash-自动化\">Autosquash 自动化</h2><p>配合 <code>--fixup</code> 和 <code>--squash</code> 提交标记，自动化 squash 流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git commit --fixup=a1b2c3d&#10;git commit --squash=a1b2c3d&#10;&#10;git rebase -i --autosquash main&#10;&#10;git config --global rebase.autosquash true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --fixup=a1b2c3d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --squash=a1b2c3d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --autosquash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase.autosquash</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git commit -m &quot;feat: add login page&quot;&#10;# 发现需要补充修改&#10;git add src/login.sh&#10;git commit --fixup=HEAD&#10;&#10;# 自动 squash&#10;git rebase -i --autosquash HEAD~3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat: add login page\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 发现需要补充修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/login.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --fixup=HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自动 squash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --autosquash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~3</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"处理变基冲突\">处理变基冲突</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git rebase -i HEAD~5&#10;# 遇到冲突&#10;vi conflicted-file.sh&#10;git add conflicted-file.sh&#10;git rebase --continue&#10;&#10;git rebase --abort\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 遇到冲突</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> conflicted-file.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> conflicted-file.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --abort</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((交互式变基))&#10;    命令&#10;      pick 保留&#10;      reword 改消息&#10;      edit 改内容&#10;      squash 合并保留消息&#10;      fixup 合并丢弃消息&#10;      drop 删除&#10;    技巧&#10;      调整顺序&#10;      autosquash&#10;      --fixup 标记&#10;    注意事项&#10;      不要重写已推送历史&#10;      冲突处理&#10;      --abort 回退\">mindmap\n  root((交互式变基))\n    命令\n      pick 保留\n      reword 改消息\n      edit 改内容\n      squash 合并保留消息\n      fixup 合并丢弃消息\n      drop 删除\n    技巧\n      调整顺序\n      autosquash\n      --fixup 标记\n    注意事项\n      不要重写已推送历史\n      冲突处理\n      --abort 回退</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>交互式变基</strong>是整理提交历史的最强大工具，提供六种操作命令</li>\n<li><strong>reword</strong> 修改消息，<strong>edit</strong> 修改内容，<strong>squash/fixup</strong> 合并提交，<strong>drop</strong> 删除提交</li>\n<li><strong>autosquash</strong> 配合 <code>--fixup</code> 提交标记可以自动化合并流程</li>\n<li>变基过程中遇到冲突需手动解决，<code>--abort</code> 可安全回退到变基前的状态</li>\n<li>遵守黄金法则：<strong>不要对已推送到公共仓库的提交执行交互式变基</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交互式变基","id":"交互式变基"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是交互式变基","id":"什么是交互式变基"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"六种操作命令","id":"六种操作命令"},{"level":2,"text":"Reword：修改提交消息","id":"reword-修改提交消息"},{"level":2,"text":"Edit：修改提交内容","id":"edit-修改提交内容"},{"level":2,"text":"Squash 与 Fixup：合并提交","id":"squash-与-fixup-合并提交"},{"level":2,"text":"Drop：删除提交","id":"drop-删除提交"},{"level":2,"text":"调整提交顺序","id":"调整提交顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"Autosquash 自动化","id":"autosquash-自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"处理变基冲突","id":"处理变基冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"暂存与工作树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/stash-and-worktree"},"next":{"title":"二分法与追溯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/bisect-and-blame"}}